<title>GERMANY: VW plans dividend rise for 1996.</title>
<headline>VW plans dividend rise for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend per ordinary share		  9   vs 6 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend per preference share		10  vs 7 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker Volkswagen AG. The company said the dividend rise would be proposed by the management to the supervisory board which will decide whether to approve it on March 21.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
